<p>
Results of Sersic profile fitting with Galfit to the mock r-band images and stellar mass projections
of EAGLE galaxies at z=0.1, as described in <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.02235">de Graaff et al. (2021)</a>.
This table includes only galaxies with stellar mass greater than 10<sup>10</sup>Msun within a spherical aperture
of radius 30 pkpc.
</p>

